'''Gingerbread''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2017 Christmas Box|Christmas Box]] during the [[Christmas Event 2017|2017 Christmas Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is made out of gingerbread, hence the name. It has two large pieces of purple candy in the center of the blade, and two strips of swirly white frosting along the edge. The guard is purple like the candy, and the handle is solid black.

